    <description>@0x1cb340 (file +0x4b140). Record 0 of 20 (0x1F bytes each) in the shift-type condition table at 0x1CB340. Reader FUN_0011733c indexes it as &amp;DAT_001cb340 + (row &amp; 0xff)*0x1f. Byte layout: +0x00..+0x12 required condition mask (19 bytes), +0x13/+0x14 up/down flags, +0x15..+0x1D per-gear enable bytes, +0x1E program/selector byte. XHP rewrites 1 of these 31 bytes. Semantics not proven; emission is per record (Task 2) so every edited byte is a cell. Confidence LOW.</description>
